{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳卓賢（Ian）昨晚（22日）出席品牌活動，一身牛仔打扮現身的他坦言，成名後更注重衣著打扮，亦相當捨得花錢購買高品質的服飾。</p><p>他在挑選時裝時着重耐看及四季皆宜：「我對喜歡的衣服很長情，有些服飾已陪伴了我5年！</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:40.576291+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:45:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:58:10.619425+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:44.275132+00:00","content_hash":"e296d6242ad7341aabdb7c6bbced1f09c494bba15f0d44e9cdc309db49c58aab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}